{"reviews":[{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-0","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and holds thick hair","x":"Very cute and look really nice for the price!! I have really thick hair and these hold it nicely without snapping open.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-1","r":5.0,"t":"I love these barrettes!","x":"Finally a barrette that is large enough to hold a twist securely that looks good too!  I was looking for something that would hold my hair up but also let me rest my head against the headrests in my car. These work perfect.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-2","r":5.0,"t":"5Pcs. Metal Hair Barrette for Thick & Medium Hair Styling","x":"Finally so glad I took the chance and ordered this great set of hair barrettes... perfect for my thick hair . The 5pcs metal are well made , sturdy, classy and most of all does not hurt my scalp even though I wear it for the whole day on my hair.  Price very good for 5pcs. set and so I decided to order more to give to family members who also have thick hair.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-3","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"Perfect for my thick hair. I cannot use a regular barrette to pull my hair back. This one works great for my top or my sides. It will not hold my top and my sides together.  I can pull back one or the other.  I am just happy that I no longer have to use 2 barrettes and several bobby pins when I want to wear my hair back off my face.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-4","r":2.0,"t":"Not for thick hair","x":"I bought them hoping I could fasten my hair into a ponytail at the nape of my neck.  They are way, way too small!  I have a ponytail that measures 4 1/2\" around, and I can't even close these.  Didn't work for me at all!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-5","r":5.0,"t":"Work well.","x":"I have very thick hair and these wouldn't work if I wanted to contain all of it but they work well for a 1/2 pull back.  Most won't work for me but these do.  The assortment of colors is attractive.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-6","r":2.0,"t":"Hair clip","x":"The clip is not as long as the barrette.  The clip itself is a bit stubborn to use.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-7","r":1.0,"t":"The actual clip is only 2.5\u201d inches long","x":"The two plastic tortoise shell ones are fine- the clip is as long as the barrette. However the clips on the metal ones are only 2.5\u201d long, so the thing sticks out an inch on each side of the ponytail- not a good look at all. I will keep them but I\u2019m guessing I will never use them.  Disappointing because I really like the brushed metal look.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-8","r":2.0,"t":"Not for thick hair","x":"I have long thick hair and theses barrettes won\u2019t hold all of my hair into a twist. I can do a ponytail with the tortoise shell barrettes, but it doesn\u2019t feel secure. The metallic barrettes are smaller and will only hold my hair half up half down. I added a picture to show my hair thickness. I would not recommend for thick hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-9","r":2.0,"t":"5 barettes are not the same size. The clasps have a 1\" difference.","x":"I wanted a 3 1/2 in. clasp and the info suggested all 5 barrettes were the same size. Not so! The clasp on the two \"ugly\" plastic barrettes were 3 1/2 in., but the three metal ones were only 2 1/2 inch. Not what I wanted. Information needs to be more specific on size.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-10","r":2.0,"t":"Two different sized clips","x":"The 5in lucite barrettes have listened 4in clip, the metal barrettes on the other hand, are 5in long, but they only have a 3in clip, which is not as listed and makes them rather limited in their usage.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-11","r":2.0,"t":"cute, but clips are weak!","x":"really cute at first look, but they didn't hold my hair. They're cheaply made. I have thin fine hair and it didn't hold my hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-12","r":2.0,"t":"5 pics hair barrettes","x":"These are good but I recently got double the amount with many choices to pick from at Walmart for a better price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-13","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty","x":"I have very thick hair, so these impressed me. True to picture.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-14","r":2.0,"t":"Pretty barrettes, but not for thick hair","x":"I like that these are basic, elegant barrettes. However, be aware that the metallic clasps are smaller in length than the tortoise ones. I have very thick hair and I can\u2019t pull all of it back with any of these barrettes. Half back at best. The tortoise barrette I use most frequently is showing signs of not wanting to clasp anymore... we\u2019ll see how long before my thick hair breaks it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-15","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap and doesn\u2019t hold hair","x":"Beautiful clips but does not hold my hair for more than an hour before the pieces fall out and can only hold a minimal amount to get it closed. Super frustrating because they are super cute and multiple colors. I have fine straight normal thickness hair and these don\u2019t work, may work better for someone with textured hair but do not recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-16","r":3.0,"t":"Disappointing. Low quality clasps.","x":"The \u201cFrench\u201d clips were very small, and even the bigger ones could not really hold and close over my healthy thick normal white woman\u2019s hair.  And the quality of the clasps are way below my other favorite French style barrettes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-17","r":3.0,"t":"2 out of 5 good","x":"2 barrettes of the 5 were full size and hold my hair well.  The other 3 have the clasp centered with the decorative part sticking out an inch on both sides. Not useful to hold hair back unless you use a few of them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-18","r":3.0,"t":"Clip on back is not 4\"","x":"The barrettes are pretty and all are 4\" on the viewable side. However, the clip on the back of 3 of them was only 2.5\" (the other two were 3.5\"). I was disappointed because I wanted the longer clip part.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-19","r":1.0,"t":"Will break","x":"Two of these broke when trying to use them the first time .. the decorative part completely snapped off the clip. I only use one on a regularly basis but it stays out and hold 1/2 to 2/3 of my hair well","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality for the price!","x":"Love these! They work well with my thick hair, and the quality is great for the price! I like the variety of colors, too! They feel sturdy and comfortable as well. I would definitely buy them again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-21","r":4.0,"t":"For thin hair","x":"These can\u2019t hold thick hair, which I feel like the ad states otherwise. They\u2019re a bit flimsy and pop right back open.  However they\u2019re excellent for half of my hair. Just not reality what I wanted.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-22","r":5.0,"t":"Versatile, good quality","x":"Perfect bundle. The leopard ones are 4 inches sizeable have smooth coating inside. Metallic ones have shorter hair clips, but actually works better for half updos. (Fine hair). Very satisfied!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-23","r":5.0,"t":"Work great on my thick hair","x":"I was skeptical at first when I saw the actual length of the hair clip, but it holds all my thick hair and the best part is that I can\u2019t feel it!  As a migraineur, this is very important!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07YFRD9ZH-24","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome !","x":"I love the barrettes because my Wife has very thick hair and she is always complaining that her hair is in her eyes these are great for keeping her hair out of her face.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers with thick hair say these barrettes hold their hair well and are sturdy and comfortable for all-day wear.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the barrettes are too small or weak to hold all of their thick hair, working only for half-up styles or not at all.","cites":[5,9,12,15]},{"text":"Reviewers note the metal barrettes have noticeably shorter clips than the plastic tortoise-shell ones, contrary to the listing.","cites":[8,10,11,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the clips stubborn or awkward to use.","cites":[7,8]},{"text":"Reviewers describe the barrettes as cute, pretty, and good value for the price.","cites":[1,3,6,12,13,14]}]},"qa":[]}